==Hungarian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈeːɡ/|lang=hu}}
* {{audio|Hu-ég.ogg|Audio}}

===Etymology 1===
Probably from {{proto|Finno-Ugric|säŋi|air|lang=hu}}. Possible cognates are limited to Baltic-Finnic (eg. Finnish {{term|sää||weather|lang=fi}}) and Komi {{term|сынӧд||warm air|tr=synöd|lang=kpv}}.

====Noun====
{{hu-noun|pl=egek}}

# [[sky]]

=====Declension=====
{{hu-decl-ek|é|g|et|stem=eg|sup=ég}}{{hu-pos-etek|eg||ei}}

=====Synonyms=====
* [[égbolt]]

=====Derived terms=====
* [[éghajlat]]
* [[égtáj]]
* [[égzengés]]
; Expressions
* [[derült égből villámcsapás]]
* [[eget-földet megmozgat]]
* [[égnek áll]]

===Etymology 2===
From {{proto|Finno-Ugric|äɳɜ|fire|lang=hu}}.

====Verb====
{{hu-verb}}

# to [[burn]]
#: '''''Ég''' a ház!'' - The house is on fire!

=====Conjugation=====
{{hu-conj-ek||é|g|intrans=y}}

